OL,3,GNEWSAFrom saddle to paddle for woman
OL,4,Awith spine injury
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former horse events rider is
OL,7,Fpreparing to represent Great Britain at
OL,8,Fthe para-canoe world championships, two
OL,9,Fyears after a fall changed her life.
OL,11,FSaffron Cresswell, 25, from Malvern in
OL,12,FWorcestershire, fell from her horse in
OL,13,F2024 and suffered a spinal cord injury
OL,14,Fwhich left her paralysed.
OL,16,FShe is now set to represent her country
OL,17,Fin a completely different sport less
OL,18,Fthan a year after discovering it,
OL,19,Ftaking up para-canoeing at Leamington
OL,20,FSpa Canoe Club on the River Leam.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,354,350,200,160,0,100
