OL,3,GNEWSAFrom saddle to paddle for woman
OL,4,Awith spine injury
OL,5,
OL,6,F"It's a beautiful sport to be involved
OL,7,Fin," she said ahead of the
OL,8,FInternational Canoe Federation Canoe
OL,9,FSprint and Para-Canoe World
OL,10,FChampionships in Poznan, Poland, which
OL,11,Fwill run from Wednesday to Sunday.
